 '<p class="practice-links"><a href="labs/context-parallel.zip" download>下载完整实验包 ↓</a> · <a href="labs/context-parallel/context_attention.py">源码</a> · <a href="labs/context-parallel/validation.json">实际记录与源码摘要</a></p>';
